license-file:
added:        2026-10-17 by salim-slimani (agent)
notes:        Effects workspace: Effect Controls with Motion, Opacity and Time Remapping on the selected clip, the Program monitor, the Effects browser open on Presets, Lumetri Presets, Audio Effects and the Video Transitions (Dissolve group) on the right, and the Essential Graphics panel below. 1600x900. Every frame shown is FilmSweet's own procedurally generated demo media (crates/media/src/generators.rs); contains no third-party, Adobe or copyrighted footage. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1).
